FEATURE SUMMARY:
----------------
Project/Organization multi-tenancy enables enterprise customers to create
isolated workspaces where teams can collaborate on apps and flows with
role-based access control.

• 6 new database entities
• 20+ RESTful API endpoints
• 5 distinct roles (ProjectAdmin, Developer, AppUser, FlowUser, Viewer)
• 3 access scopes (Personal, Project, Public)
• Role-based dashboards and navigation
• Backward compatible (zero breaking changes)
• 8-week implementation timeline

